# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, "lib/" matches a
# directory called lib at ANY depth — including web/frontend/src/lib, which is
# source, not build output. That silently dropped src/lib/glossary.ts and
# src/lib/explain.ts from two commits; both compiled locally and broke the
# production build. These entries exist for a Python distribution at the root.
/lib/
/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

